{"unit_id":"xmanrui__dsh-dingtalk#card-zh","repo":"xmanrui/dsh-dingtalk","commit":"84101dc58cdfe951c11bf1525136ad677aa6101e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dingtalk 是一个 DeepSeek Harness Web 插件，通过设置页的钉钉二维码授权将钉钉机器人接入 Harness。Host 负责保存凭据并通过钉钉 Stream 收发消息，设置页可查看连接状态和管理机器人。它支持扫码创建机器人、私聊文字和 @ 机器人的群聊文字、连续会话映射，以及将 Harness 回复更新到钉钉 AI Card。适合希望从钉钉与 Harness 对话的用户；需有具备机器人创建权限的钉钉组织账号，并运行 DSH Web。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin-src/client/index.js:73","plugin-src/host/production.mjs:62","src/dingtalk-runtime.mjs:247"]}
{"unit_id":"xmanrui__dsh-dingtalk#card-en","repo":"xmanrui/dsh-dingtalk","commit":"84101dc58cdfe951c11bf1525136ad677aa6101e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-dingtalk connects DingTalk bots to DeepSeek Harness through QR authorization. It stores credentials on the Host, receives direct and group messages, maps chats to Harness sessions, and returns replies in an updating AI Card. Requires an organization account allowed to create bots and DSH Web.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin-src/client/index.js:73","plugin-src/host/production.mjs:62","src/dingtalk-runtime.mjs:247"]}
